.chapter 9
.h1 Open items and lessons [lessons]
The record, read to the last commit of 19 November, leaves these open items and
lessons.
.h2 Open items [lessons-left]
{Tab:open} lists the open items; the worklist has all of them.
.tabcap open Open items
.table 22 42
Item | State
UTF-8 | Stage 0 is done: UTF-8 and Latin-1 are character sets of Import and
 | Export, and the keyboard takes any character.  Documents stay in the
 | character set of the old program, so an import turns a character with no
 | place in it into a question mark.
Mouse | The study recommends a staged plan.  Neither version takes mouse input.
Colour in documents | The study is written.  Screen and pictures have colour,
 | but text has none.
Merge, Batch Print | Not built ({x:conditional-honest}).
Token of two bytes | Next step for memory ({x:memory-notdone}).
.end
.h2 Lessons [lessons-lessons]
Each lesson names its evidence ({tab:lessons}).
